Every church plant starts with a handful of people willing to say yes before anything is certain. Here are a few of their stories.

## "We wanted our kids to see faith in action"

When the Thompsons heard about Ember, they knew it was a chance to show their kids what it looks like to build something for others.

## "I was tired of being a spectator"

For Chris, joining the launch team meant moving from the back row to the front lines — setting up chairs at 6am and loving every minute.
